### List all posts of all users
GET http://localhost:5000/api/posts
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..KBbgPMOq1GrQTIroDXEGLyv7A4ntcyusiq6ztzUz3gs

### List one post by id
GET http://localhost:5000/api/posts/1
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..KBbgPMOq1GrQTIroDXEGLyv7A4ntcyusiq6ztzUz3gs

### Update post by id (PUT)
PUT http://localhost:5000/api/posts/1
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..KBbgPMOq1GrQTIroDXEGLyv7A4ntcyusiq6ztzUz3gs
Content-Type: application/json

